      "value": "Hello, thank you for your request!\n\nWe probably won't be able to whitelist those two scripts in particular, but allowing scripts on avatars is something we've considered in the past.\n\nYou may want to our PhysBone system, which we released last year. It should allow you to achieve something very similar to those spring bone scripts!\n\nPlease let us know if you have any other questions.",
