  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello, I am a newbie who just recently started VRChat.\nThank you very much for VRChat's service from day to day!\nI am glad to use it for the New Year too!\n\nWell, I will get into the main theme.\nI am sending mail this time because there is a proposal to make VRChat better.\n\nWhen you want to shake objects with VRChat chat, there is no other way to use \"Dynamic Bone\" except for Unity components.\nHowever, it costs money.\n\nSo I have a good idea.\n\nThere is a character called Unity - chan provided by Unity Technologies Japan.\nWill you make available \"SpringBone\" and \"SpringManager\" included in it?\nWith this can can express shakes of cloth, hair, accessories etc!\nPlease refer to the URL for the way Unity-chan or actually trying.\n\nhttp://unity-chan.com/ contents/about/\nhttp://tsubakit1.hateblo.jp/ entry/2014/11/08/233000\n\nAlso, I personally think that it is good to be able to use the component created by ricopin.\n\nhttp://rocketjump.skr.jp/unity 3d / 109 /\nhttps://twitter.com/ricopin416\n\n\nCome, thank you for your consideration!\n\n* This email has been translated by Google translation. I'm sorry! *",
